      "side": 1,
      "message": "Optional factorization: Could this live alongside the VLIB buffer-chain helpers? The operation has no IP-specific semantics. There isn\u0027t an existing truncation helper that directly replaces it; vlib_buffer_chain_linearize() provides shared-tail handling, but would also copy/compact the packet. A generic trim helper would let other callers reuse the chain traversal, tail cleanup, and sharing logic.",
      "revId": "6237005e9df5da3e0c3817fddaf348a4ac2bd5c5",
